    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "motion-velocity-context",
        "moduleId": "problem-context",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "刚体上一点的速度",
        "markdown": "在惯性固定参考系 $A$ 中观察单个刚体 $B$：点 $P$ 的绝对速度记为 $v_P$，绝对加速度记为 $a_P$；刚体的绝对角速度记为 $Ω_B$，绝对角加速度记为 $Ψ_B$。教材把这些量都定义为相对惯性系的绝对量，所以在谈“速度”之前，必须先说明是在哪个参考系里观察。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000011"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 2 Kinematics",
                "Velocity in Moving Bodies"
              ],
              "lineStart": 161,
              "lineEnd": 179,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3a08dbe188792ce6a01143a2edba88d2c4218c160767e9886dd9d8c9348036f8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "why-composition-matters",
        "moduleId": "problem-context",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么需要速度合成",
        "markdown": "刚体可以同时平动和转动。如果只记住“速度等于位置对时间求导”，就容易漏掉转动带来的那部分速度。下面的推导把 $P$ 的速度拆成随参考点 $B$ 的平动项与绕 $B$ 的转动项：平动项描述刚体整体被带着走，转动项描述点绕参考点扫过的切向速度，两者相加才是完整的绝对速度。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "motion-velocity-context"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "velocity-vs-coordinate-derivative",
        "moduleId": "absolute-vs-coordinate",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "绝对速度与坐标导数",
        "markdown": "绝对速度是位置向量对时间的绝对变化率，而不是位置坐标对时间的普通导数。只有当用来表示位置的参考系是惯性系时，两者才相等；在运动参考系中直接对坐标求导，得到的不是该点在惯性系中的绝对速度。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000011"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 2 Kinematics",
                "Velocity in Moving Bodies"
              ],
              "lineStart": 161,
              "lineEnd": 179,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3a08dbe188792ce6a01143a2edba88d2c4218c160767e9886dd9d8c9348036f8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "inertial-frame-trap",
        "moduleId": "absolute-vs-coordinate",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "常见误区：把坐标导数当成速度",
        "markdown": "常见误区：把运动参考系中的坐标导数直接当成绝对速度。例如站在旋转平台上记录一个固定于平台的点，它在平台坐标中的读数不变、坐标导数为零，但它在惯性系中的速度并不为零。判断时应先问：这个导数是“在哪个参考系里、对哪个向量”做的；若在运动系中求导，就必须补上坐标系转动带来的变化。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "velocity-vs-coordinate-derivative"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "position-via-transformation",
        "moduleId": "composition-derivation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "用变换分解点的位置",
        "markdown": "把 $P$ 的位置分解为从惯性系原点 $A$ 到刚体参考点 $B$ 的平移，加上从 $B$ 到 $P$ 的旋转：$$r_{AP} = r_{AB} + C_{AB} r_{BP}$$ 其中 $C_{AB}$ 把在 $B$ 中表达的向量转换到 $A$ 中。于是速度问题转化为对这个复合位置表达式求时间导数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000011"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 2 Kinematics",
                "Velocity in Moving Bodies"
              ],
              "lineStart": 161,
              "lineEnd": 179,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3a08dbe188792ce6a01143a2edba88d2c4218c160767e9886dd9d8c9348036f8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "rigid-body-derivative-terms",
        "moduleId": "composition-derivation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "求导后的三项与刚体约束",
        "markdown": "对复合位置式求导会出现三项：参考点速度 $v_B$、旋转矩阵导数项 $Ċ_{AB} r_{BP}$，以及点相对参考点的坐标导数项 $C_{AB} ṙ_{BP}$。因为 $P$ 固定在刚体 $B$ 上，相对坐标导数为零；又因为旋转矩阵的导数可写成角速度的反对称矩阵 $[ω_{AB}]×$ 左乘 $C_{AB}$，即 $Ċ_{AB} = [ω_{AB}]× C_{AB}$，旋转项就化成了角速度与相对位置向量的叉乘。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000011"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 2 Kinematics",
                "Velocity in Moving Bodies"
              ],
              "lineStart": 161,
              "lineEnd": 179,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3a08dbe188792ce6a01143a2edba88d2c4218c160767e9886dd9d8c9348036f8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "compose-velocity-steps",
        "moduleId": "composition-derivation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "逐步合成速度",
        "markdown": "把三项逐步代入：$v_P = v_B + Ċ_{AB} r_{BP} + C_{AB} ṙ_{BP}$。由于 $P$ 固定于 $B$，$ṙ_{BP} = 0$；再用 $Ċ_{AB} = [ω_{AB}]× C_{AB}$，得到 $v_P = v_B + ω_{AB} × (C_{AB} r_{BP})$。把 $C_{AB} r_{BP}$ 理解为在惯性系中从 $B$ 指向 $P$ 的向量，这就是“参考点速度 + 绕参考点转动速度”的合成。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "position-via-transformation",
            "rigid-body-derivative-terms"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "velocity-composition-rule",
        "moduleId": "composition-derivation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "刚体速度合成规则",
        "markdown": "这就是刚体速度的经典形式，也称为速度合成规则：$$v_P = v_B + Ω_B × r_{BP}$$ 其中 $r_{BP}$ 是从 $B$ 指向 $P$ 的向量，$Ω_B$ 是刚体的绝对角速度。换用刚体上另一个参考点时，平动项与转动项会重新分配，但由它们合成的 $v_P$ 保持不变。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000011"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 2 Kinematics",
                "Velocity in Moving Bodies"
              ],
              "lineStart": 161,
              "lineEnd": 179,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3a08dbe188792ce6a01143a2edba88d2c4218c160767e9886dd9d8c9348036f8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "terms-of-composition",
        "moduleId": "composition-derivation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "两项的物理含义",
        "markdown": "两项各有清楚的物理含义：$v_B$ 是刚体整体平动时所有点共有的速度，$Ω_B × r_{BP}$ 是绕 $B$ 转动时点 $P$ 获得的切向速度。若刚体只平动，$Ω_B = 0$，刚体上各点速度相同；若参考点 $B$ 恰好位于转轴上，则 $v_P$ 只剩下转动项。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "velocity-composition-rule",
            "compose-velocity-steps"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "moving-frame-euler-warning",
        "moduleId": "moving-frame-and-transfer",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "运动坐标系中的求导",
        "markdown": "在运动坐标系中求导要格外小心：一般情况下速度并不等于位置坐标对时间的导数，只有在对非运动（惯性）系求导时二者才相等。如果必须在运动系中表示，就要使用欧拉求导规则，把“向量自身的变化”和“坐标系转动带来的变化”分开处理。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
